0016:     Rule
0017:     - Create one output panel with the same shape as a single input panel.
0018:     - Paint the upper-left panel first, then lower-right, then lower-left,
0019:       then upper-right.
0020:     - Only non-background pixels are painted; later panels overwrite earlier
0021:       pixels at the same position.
0022: 
0023:     Key insight
0024:     - The four panels are transparent layers whose depth is determined by panel
0025:       position, not by numeric color order.
